"""Lecture 35 vignette pool C -- Asthma: ordering and reading tests, home monitoring and the action plan,
the visit sequence, and what to tell the patient about course and medicines.

KEYS ARE WRITTEN SHORT ON PURPOSE -- detail lives in the explanation.
EXPLANATIONS follow tools/question_writing/EXPLAIN_DEEP.md (2026-10-29).

Patients are 12 or older. No emergency management (not testable for CMS I); the danger signs and zones on
the action plan are patient education.
"""
import os, sys
sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
